# NOTE: `files/` and `patches/` used to be ignored wholesale here, from before
# kde-build-meta was folded into this repo. Both are build-input trees now —
# 367 and 81 tracked files, reached by `kind: local` sources and by
# freedesktop-sdk.bst's patch queue — so the blanket rules only made `git add`
# refuse legitimate new inputs and hid them from `git status`. That is how
# files/fakecap/fakecap-restore.c stayed missing after the tromso-iso merge
# dropped it. Ignore specific generated paths instead (see below).

